    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "RBI was established on April 1, 1935, under the RBI Act, 1934, following recommendations of the Hilton Young Commission.",
        "Difference between CRR (cash held with RBI) and SLR (liquid assets held by bank with itself) is crucial for competitive exams.",
        "RTGS works in real-time with a minimum settlement limit, while NEFT operates in half-hourly batches."
      ],
